#: src/format/markdown.md:1
msgid "Markdown"
msgstr "Markdown指南"

#: src/format/markdown.md:3
msgid ""
"mdBook's [parser](https://github.com/raphlinus/pulldown-cmark) adheres to "
"the [CommonMark](https://commonmark.org/) specification with some extensions "
"described below. You can take a quick [tutorial](https://commonmark.org/help/"
"tutorial/), or [try out](https://spec.commonmark.org/dingus/) CommonMark in "
"real time. A complete Markdown overview is out of scope for this "
"documentation, but below is a high level overview of some of the basics. For "
"a more in-depth experience, check out the [Markdown Guide](https://www."
"markdownguide.org)."
msgstr ""
"mdBook的[解析器](https://github.com/raphlinus/pulldown-cmark)遵循[CommonMark]"
"(https://commonmark.org/)规范，并有一些扩展功能，具体说明如下。您可以快速参考"
"[教程](https://commonmark.org/help/tutorial/)，或者实时尝试使用[CommonMark]"
"(https://spec.commonmark.org/dingus/)。关于Markdown的完整概述不在本文档的范围"
"内，但以下是对一些基本功能的概述。如需更深入的体验，请查阅[Markdown指南]"
"(https://www.markdownguide.org)。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:9
msgid "Text and Paragraphs"
msgstr ""

#: src/format/markdown.md:11
msgid "Text is rendered relatively predictably:"
msgstr "文本的呈现相对具有可预测性："

#: src/format/markdown.md:19
msgid "Will look like you might expect:"
msgstr "看起来会像你预期的那样："

#: src/format/markdown.md:21
msgid "Here is a line of text."
msgstr "这是一行文本。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:23
msgid "This is a new line."
msgstr "这是一行新的内容。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:25
msgid "Headings"
msgstr "标题"

#: src/format/markdown.md:27
msgid ""
"Headings use the `#` marker and should be on a line by themselves. More `#` "
"mean smaller headings:"
msgstr "标题使用`#`标记，应该自己在线。更多`#`意味着小标题："

#: src/format/markdown.md:39
msgid "A heading"
msgstr "一个标题"

#: src/format/markdown.md:41
msgid "Some text."
msgstr "一些文字."

#: src/format/markdown.md:43
msgid "A smaller heading"
msgstr "一个小的标题"

#: src/format/markdown.md:45
msgid "More text."
msgstr "更多文本。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:47
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

#: src/format/markdown.md:49
msgid ""
"Lists can be unordered or ordered. Ordered lists will order automatically:"
msgstr "列表可以是无序的，也可以是有序的。有序列表会自动进行排序："

#: src/format/markdown.md:61
msgid "milk"
msgstr "milk"

#: src/format/markdown.md:62
msgid "eggs"
msgstr "eggs"

#: src/format/markdown.md:63
msgid "butter"
msgstr "butter"

#: src/format/markdown.md:65
msgid "carrots"
msgstr "carrots"

#: src/format/markdown.md:66
msgid "celery"
msgstr "celery"

#: src/format/markdown.md:67
msgid "radishes"
msgstr "radishes"

#: src/format/markdown.md:69
msgid "Links"
msgstr "链接"

#: src/format/markdown.md:71
msgid "Linking to a URL or local file is easy:"
msgstr "链接到URL或本地文件非常简单："

#: src/format/markdown.md:85
msgid "Use [mdBook](https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook)."
msgstr "使用 [mdBook](https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook)。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:87
msgid "Read about [mdBook](mdbook.md)."
msgstr "阅读关于 [mdBook](mdbook.md)。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:89
msgid ""
"And now [an mdBook link](https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook) that is not "
"inline, unlike the above."
msgstr "现在有一个[mdBook链接]，它并不是内联的，与上述情况不同。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:91
msgid "A bare url: <https://www.rust-lang.org>."
msgstr "一个简单的网址： <https://www.rust-lang.org>。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:96
msgid ""
"Relative links that end with `.md` will be converted to the `.html` "
"extension. It is recommended to use `.md` links when possible. This is "
"useful when viewing the Markdown file outside of mdBook, for example on "
"GitHub or GitLab which render Markdown automatically."
msgstr ""
"以 `.md` 结尾的相对链接将被转换为 `.html` 扩展形式。建议尽可能使用 `.md` 链"
"接。这在在 mdBook 外部查看 Markdown 文件时非常有用，例如在 GitHub 或 GitLab "
"上，这些平台会自动渲染 Markdown 格式。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:100
msgid ""
"Links to `README.md` will be converted to `index.html`. This is done since "
"some services like GitHub render README files automatically, but web servers "
"typically expect the root file to be called `index.html`."
msgstr ""
"链接从 `README.md` 转换为 `index.html`。这是因为一些服务如 GitHub 会自动渲染 "
"README 文件，但Web服务器通常期望根文件的名称为 `index.html`。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:103
msgid ""
"You can link to individual headings with `#` fragments. For example, `mdbook."
"md#text-and-paragraphs` would link to the [Text and Paragraphs](#text-and-"
"paragraphs) section above. The ID is created by transforming the heading "
"such as converting to lowercase and replacing spaces with dashes. You can "
"click on any heading and look at the URL in your browser to see what the "
"fragment looks like."
msgstr ""
"您可以链接到单个标题与 #` 片段。例如，`mdbook.md#text-and-paragraphs会链接到"
"上面的 [文本和段落](#文本和段落) 部分。 ID是通过转换标题创建的，如转换为小写"
"和用破折号替换空格。 您可以点击任何标题并查看浏览器中的URL来查看片段的外观。"

#: src/format/markdown.md:108
msgid "Images"
msgstr "图片"

#: src/format/markdown.md:110
msgid ""
"Including images is simply a matter of including a link to them, much like "
"in the _Links_ section above. The following markdown includes the Rust logo "
"SVG image found in the `images` directory at the same level as this file:"
msgstr ""
"包含图片只需提供图片的链接即可，就像在上面的“链接”部分一样。以下Markdown代码"
"包含了位于与当前文件同一级别的 `images` 目录中的Rust徽标SVG图片："

#: src/format/markdown.md:117
msgid "Produces the following HTML when built with mdBook:"
msgstr "使用 mdBook 构建时会产生以下 HTML："

#: src/format/markdown.md:120
msgid "\"images/rust-logo-blk.svg\""
msgstr "\"images/rust-logo-blk.svg\""

#: src/format/markdown.md:120
msgid "\"The Rust Logo\""
msgstr "\"Rust Logo\""

#: src/format/markdown.md:123
msgid "Which, of course displays the image like so:"
msgstr "当然，这样就会显示图片："

#: src/format/markdown.md:125
msgid "![The Rust Logo](images/rust-logo-blk.svg)"
msgstr "![The Rust Logo](images/rust-logo-blk.svg)"

#: src/format/markdown.md:127
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展功能"

#: src/format/markdown.md:129
msgid ""
"mdBook has several extensions beyond the standard CommonMark specification."
msgstr "mdBook 除了标准的 CommonMark 规范之外，还提供了多种扩展功能。"

